        },
        "quote": "(a) “False alarm” shall be defined as an alarm signal eliciting a response by the police where an emergency situation does not in fact exist.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.05.070:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 8.05.070 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "89bdbbdf-eb3d-533c-bd7c-c8c4bacda055",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 397,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.05.070:block:1",
          "start": 142
        },
        "quote": "(b) Alarm users shall not be assessed any service charge for false alarms caused by interruption or failure of the service provided by public utilities, electrical or electronic interruption or interference, acts of God, sonic booms, or traffic accidents.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.05.070:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 8.05.070 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "6e80c85f-1ccb-5b0e-b7c3-168da2fc8b6d",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1003,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.05.070:block:2",
          "start": 398
        },
        "quote": "(c) There shall be a grace period of six months from the date of the initial installation. For each false alarm not within the grace period, there shall be a service charge imposed per false alarm as prescribed by the City’s fee schedule. Only the first four false alarms shall be deemed within the grace period even if otherwise covered by the grace period. Following the grace period, alarm system users shall not be assessed a fine for the first two false alarms in any one calendar year. For purposes of implementing this section, calendar year shall be deemed to be January 1st through December 31st.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.05.070:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 8.05.070 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "429ca35c-cebc-57e3-8db7-f244bf7c3b55",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1232,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.05.070:block:3",
          "start": 1004
        },
        "quote": "(d) A service charge shall be paid by the alarm user to the City for each false alarm not otherwise exempted by this section. The proceeds from such false alarm service charges shall be deposited to the general fund of the City.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.05.070:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 8.05.070 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "9bbf82b1-c867-5f68-9418-f23252550de7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1471,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:8.05.070:block:4",
          "start": 1233
        },
        "quote": "(e) Any service charge assessed pursuant to this section may, upon request of the alarm user, be reviewed by the Police Department in accordance with such review procedures as the Chief of Police may prescribe. (Ord. 20631 § 38, 1-13-26.)",
